<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Agent Details - Valorant Protocol</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="index.html">VALORANT PROTOCOL</a>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="details.html">Details</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="about.html">About</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="new-character-form.html">Add a Character</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container my-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                <img src="images/jett.jfif" class="img-fluid rounded shadow border border-secondary" alt="Jett Large">
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold" style="color: #ff4655;">JETT</h1>
                <span class="badge badge-duelist fs-6 mb-3">Duelist</span>
                
                <ul class="list-unstyled mt-3 text-light">
                    <li><strong>Real Name:</strong> Sunwoo Han</li>
                    <li><strong>Origin:</strong> South Korea</li>
                    <li><strong>First Appearance:</strong> Valorant Beta (2020)</li>
                    <li><strong>Signature Ability:</strong> Tailwind (Dash)</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-4 border-bottom pb-2 text-white">Abilities</h3>
                <ul class="text-light">
                    <li><strong>Cloudburst (C):</strong> Throw a vision-blocking cloud of fog.</li>
                    <li><strong>Updraft (Q):</strong> Instantly launch Jett high into the air.</li>
                    <li><strong>Tailwind (E):</strong> Dash quickly in the direction of movement.</li>
                    <li><strong>Blade Storm (X):</strong> Equip a set of lethal throwing daggers.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="mt-4 border-bottom pb-2 text-white">Backstory</h3>
                <p class="text-light">Representing her home country of South Korea, Jett's agile and evasive fighting style allows her to take risks no one else can. She runs circles around every skirmish, cutting enemies up before they even know what hit them.</p>

                <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-outline-light mt-3">Back to Gallery</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>